Upstream baseline: ai 7.0.155 video generation, submission, and status
APIs. prepareRetries, mergeAbortSignals, and mergeCallbacks are imported
directly from ai/internal through one version-pinned integration module.
Public @ai-sdk/provider-utils 5.0.70 helpers are used as dependencies.

Modified to support typed asset kinds, provider-bound operation handles,
explicit submission idempotency, remote cancellation, and URL-preserving
results. Callbacks are awaited observations whose errors are ignored;
cancellation uses cooperative signals. Asset submit/status/poll/result
orchestration is still maintained by SineStack AI.

See upstream.json and docs/UPSTREAM.md in the SineStack AI source repository
for reviewed source files, SHA-256 hashes, and upgrade policy.
